><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">imi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{latent}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为蓄冷介质可用相变潜热，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为保温箱总传热系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{amb}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">amb</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为环境温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{limit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">imi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该温区允许上限。环境温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{amb}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">amb</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越高（夏季正午），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越短——这正是「同一套包装夏季冬季表现不同」的数学根源，选型与验证方法见同章 <a href=\"../thermal-packaging-equipment/insulation-box-material-model\">保温箱材料模型</a> 与 <a href=\"../thermal-packaging-equipment/packaging-qualification-seasonal-test\">包装资质与季节性验证</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断链事件的判定-隔离与处置\">断链事件的判定、隔离与处置</h2><p>断链处置最容易犯的错是<strong>先看货坏没坏，再决定要不要上报</strong>。合规的做法是反过来：<strong>只要温度证据显示超出设定范围，就先隔离、先立偏差，再由有资质的人判定放行与否</strong>，全程留痕。</p>\n<p>处置流程遵循「发现—隔离—调查—判定—放行/销毁—纠正措施」六步，且每一步都要有时间戳和责任人：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[记录仪/IoT 发现超温] --&gt; B[立即隔离货物&lt;br/&gt;挂断链标识]&#10;  B --&gt; C[冻结相关批次&lt;br/&gt;暂停出库]&#10;  C --&gt; D[立偏差记录&lt;br/&gt;编号+时间+责任人]&#10;  D --&gt; E[收集证据&lt;br/&gt;温度曲线+时长+峰值]&#10;  E --&gt; F[按MKT与产品标签判定]&#10;  F --&gt; G{可用性判定}&#10;  G --&gt;|合格| H[质量负责人签字放行]&#10;  G --&gt;|不确定| I[送检/问供应商]&#10;  G --&gt;|不合格| J[报废或退回]&#10;  H --&gt; K[纠正措施&lt;br/&gt;修交接C错]&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[归档偏差与放行记录]\">flowchart TD\n  A[记录仪/IoT 发现超温] --&gt; B[立即隔离货物&lt;br/&gt;挂断链标识]\n  B --&gt; C[冻结相关批次&lt;br/&gt;暂停出库]\n  C --&gt; D[立偏差记录&lt;br/&gt;编号+时间+责任人]\n  D --&gt; E[收集证据&lt;br/&gt;温度曲线+时长+峰值]\n  E --&gt; F[按MKT与产品标签判定]\n  F --&gt; G{可用性判定}\n  G --&gt;|合格| H[质量负责人签字放行]\n  G --&gt;|不确定| I[送检/问供应商]\n  G --&gt;|不合格| J[报废或退回]\n  H --&gt; K[纠正措施&lt;br/&gt;修交接C错]\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[归档偏差与放行记录]</pre><p>判定环节的核心工具是<strong>平均动力学温度（MKT）与产品标签允许范围</strong>，而不是简单看峰值。一个短暂冲到 9 ℃ 又迅速回落的 2–8 ℃ 药品，其 MKT 可能仍在可接受区间；反之长时间贴着上限运行，即使从未「超标」，MKT 也可能不合格。MKT 公式与阈值见 <a href=\"../cold-chain-requirements-products/time-temperature-tolerance-model\">温度-时间耐受度模型</a>。判定权限归<strong>质量负责人或受训人员</strong>，作业员无权自行放行——这是 GDP、HACCP 体系共同的质量门。</p>\n<p>对<strong>食品</strong>而言，断链处置依据是 HACCP 中「关键限值（critical limit）偏离」的处理逻辑；对<strong>药品</strong>，欧盟 GDP 指南明确要求对偏差进行调查、评估影响、记录结论，并对承运方与运输路线做再确认。WHO 对疫苗链路的建议更直接：到达时若温度指示器（VVM）或记录显示暴露，需按管理规定做<strong>是否可用的判定</strong>，并对冷冻敏感疫苗额外做**摇晃试验（shake test）**以识别已被冻结失效的批次。</p>\n<p>最后一步纠正措施必须落到<strong>机制</strong>：若偏差根因是「装载堵住回风口」，就改装载 SOP 并培训；若是「中转点无温度记录」，就在中转点增设记录仪布点。布点原则见 <a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-chain/logger-sensor-deployment\">温控记录仪与IoT传感器布点</a>，实时告警见 <a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-chain/realtime-monitoring-alerting\">实时监控与告警</a>。偏差与放行记录应作为质量记录归档，跨境场景还需符合目的国的数据留存要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷链断链极少发生在段中间，<strong>集中发生在交接瞬间</strong>；SOP 的本质是给每次交接设「货物+温度证据+责任签字」三件套。</li>\n<li>仓储段：<strong>到货验收先隔离、库位按温区物理隔离、出库暂存设时限（常见 ≤30 分钟）</strong>。</li>\n<li>干线段：<strong>装车前必须预冷并留证、装载不得堵回风口/贴壁/混温区、到站共判剩余冷量</strong>。</li>\n<li>末端段：<strong>转运换装再查介质、交付形态决定温控可行性、签收随单交付全程温度曲线</strong>。</li>\n<li>断链处置六步：<strong>发现→隔离→立偏差→集证→MKT判定→放行/销毁+纠正措施</strong>，判定权归质量负责人，作业员不得自行放行。</li>\n<li>纠正措施必须落到机制（改 SOP、加布点、改装载方式），而不是归咎个人。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冷链仓储、干线运输与末端交付作业SOP","id":"冷链仓储-干线运输与末端交付作业sop"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三段式作业与「交接即断点」的设计","id":"核心概念-三段式作业与-交接即断点-的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"仓储段：收货、上架与限时暂存","id":"仓储段-收货-上架与限时暂存"},{"level":2,"text":"干线运输段：预冷、装载与到站交接","id":"干线运输段-预冷-装载与到站交接"},{"level":2,"text":"末端交付：最后一公里的温控与签收","id":"末端交付-最后一公里的温控与签收"},{"level":2,"text":"断链事件的判定、隔离与处置","id":"断链事件的判定-隔离与处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"温控数据完整性与审计追溯链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cold-chain-temperature-controlled-logistics/temperature-monitoring-chain/temperature-data-integrity-audit"},"next":{"title":"断链超温事故处置与货损判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cold-chain-temperature-controlled-logistics/cold-chain-ops-compliance/excursion-broken-chain-disposition"}}